sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant Runner as Local runner / SDK
    participant API as OpenAI API
    participant Capture as Local tools and capture
    participant Disk as New local run directory
    participant Viewer as Browser viewer
    Operator->>Runner: Start bounded fictional account workflow
    Runner->>Capture: Generate account and issue root grant
    Capture->>Disk: Save account and append capture records
    Runner->>API: Coordinator task and enabled tools
    API-->>Runner: read_account call
    Runner->>Capture: Bind call ID, read account, record completed action
    Runner->>API: Tool result, researcher handoff now available
    API-->>Runner: Handoff to Researcher
    Runner->>Capture: Record SDK callback, issue child grant
    Runner->>API: Researcher task and enabled tools
    API-->>Runner: read_account call
    Runner->>Capture: Bind call ID, read account, record completed action
    Runner->>API: Tool result, reporter handoff now available
    API-->>Runner: Handoff to Reporter
    Runner->>Capture: Record SDK callback, issue summary-only grant
    Runner->>API: Reporter task and save tool
    API-->>Runner: save_summary call with model-written text
    Runner->>Capture: Write fixed summary, record completed action
    Capture->>Disk: Save summary and raw source records
    Runner->>API: Tool result
    API-->>Runner: Final response
    Runner->>Capture: Verify required actions and handoffs, normalize
    Capture->>Disk: Save investigation, mappings, result and hash manifest
    Operator->>Viewer: Choose completed investigation.json
    Viewer->>Viewer: Validate locally, evaluate records, show evidence
    Note over Runner,Disk: Failures preserve partial records and safe failure metadata, no scripted substitute
    Viewer->>Viewer: Save normalized evidence in bounded browser localStorage
    Operator->>Viewer: Reload same dashboard origin
    Viewer->>Viewer: Revalidate saved records, reevaluate and restore selected hop
    Note over Viewer: Clear control removes local copies, no upload or provider connection
